    <briefdescription>
<para>A learned access pattern derived from the address history. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>The <computeroutput><ref refid="structthemis_1_1performance_1_1_intelligent_prefetcher_1_1_access_pattern_1a874766351272a6ad914c594f65539163" kindref="member">addresses</ref></computeroutput> vector holds the raw addresses captured in the window. <computeroutput><ref refid="structthemis_1_1performance_1_1_intelligent_prefetcher_1_1_access_pattern_1a1fab43f38c5a313de28b4cb4f3555b10" kindref="member">stride</ref></computeroutput> is the dominant difference between consecutive addresses. <computeroutput><ref refid="structthemis_1_1performance_1_1_intelligent_prefetcher_1_1_access_pattern_1ab92e86c99ad15b439448ee13283be398" kindref="member">confidence</ref></computeroutput> is in [0, 1] and reflects how consistently the stride was observed. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
